 user?\r\n\r\nYes, it's still needed because engine (main.cpp) on start tries to set the orientation to `Landscape` (which is default), so we are overriding that request.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c12e51972a41665743be79c7d3e3fd5c871d97f3/main/main.cpp#L3364-L3365\r\n\r\nWe could update that logic directly there, but that would require more changes than handling it here, where we can override it only for the Android editor. We can move the logic there once the editor fully supports orientation changes.","created_at":"2026-07-19T10:23:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T10:23:24Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121387#discussion_r3610366357","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121387","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610366357"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121387#discussion_r3610366357"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121387"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610366357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":722,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":727,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3609988201,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":23,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610378125","pull_request_review_id":4730591041,"id":3610378125,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7XMf-N","diff_hunk":"@@ -712,6 +719,13 @@ abstract class BaseGodotEditor : GodotActivity(), GameMenuFragment.GameMenuListe\n \t\t}\n \n \toverride fun setRequestedOrientation(requestedOrientation: Int) {\n+\t\tif (isLargeScreen || godot?.isProjectManagerHint() == true) {\n+\t\t\t// Godot tries to lock the orientation to landscape during initialization.\n+\t\t\t// Ove