ntainer->get_combined_minimum_size().width` directly, the threshold would start fluctuating. Once the window becomes compact enough, we'd hide `project_list_sidebar`, which changes the container's minimum size. In the next instant, `get_combined_minimum_size().width` becomes smaller than `get_size().width`, causing the sidebar to become visible again. That, in turn, increases the minimum size, and the process repeats, resulting in the sidebar continuously toggling.\r\n\r\nCaching the threshold once in NOTIFICATION_READY avoids this loop by keeping the threshold stable regardless of the sidebar's current visibility.","created_at":"2026-07-19T15:25:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T15:25:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121387#discussion_r3610829140","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121387","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610829140"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121387#discussion_r3610829140"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121387"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610829140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":115,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3610808112,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610830884","pull_request_review_id":4730998905,"id":3610830884,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7XOOgk","diff_hunk":"@@ -712,6 +719,17 @@ abstract class BaseGodotEditor : GodotActivity(), GameMenuFragment.GameMenuListe\n \t\t}\n \n \toverride fun setRequestedOrientation(requestedOrientation: Int) {\n+\t\tif (isNativeXRDevice(applicationContext)) {\n+\t\t\treturn\n+\t\t